minti-status (0.1.0-M7.4) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Cross-platform sysinfo polish: real CPU model + uptime + OS version
    on Windows (registry / RtlGetVersion / GetTickCount64) and macOS
    (sysctl machdep.cpu.brand_string / kern.boottime / sw_vers); Linux
    gains /proc/uptime read so it's no longer the only platform without
    an Uptime row. New System panel layout: OS / Kernel / Uptime / CPU
    / GPU / RAM. Three new golden scenarios: system_windows,
    system_darwin, system_no_uptime. 18 goldens total, all green.

 -- MINTI Project <minti@localhost>  Sat, 06 Jun 2026 16:00:00 +0000

minti-status (0.1.0-M7.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Clan panel quality: wired through cland's real peers --json schema
    (reasoning/system scores from latest_ad, OS + GPU + VRAM per member,
    last_ad as RFC3339 timestamp); synthesised self row at top of the
    members table; deduped election history (group by term+winner with
    a ×N repetition count instead of 32 identical rows); Candidates
    section for mDNS-discovered nodes not yet member-added; parseShow
    now case-insensitive (cland writes "Role:" / "Member ID:" not lower).

 -- MINTI Project <minti@localhost>  Sat, 06 Jun 2026 15:00:00 +0000

minti-status (0.1.0-M7) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release. Read-only terminal-UI dashboard for MINTI nodes.
    Surfaces Clan + Runtime + Ollama VRAM + Addons + Harness state on
    three independent refresh tickers. Cross-compiles to Linux, Windows,
    and macOS (amd64 + arm64).

